{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02823","headline":"山行寄刘李二参军 · 卢照邻","name":"山行寄刘李二参军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里烟尘客，三春桃李时。\n事去纷无限，愁来不自持。\n狂歌欲叹凤，失路反占龟。\n草碍人行缓，花繁鸟度迟。\n彼美参卿事，留连求友诗。\n安知倦游子，两鬓渐如丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}